# Optional — the app runs fine without this; render/browser errors just
# stay in the visitor's own console instead of being reported anywhere.
# Set it (a Sentry project DSN) to have crashes caught by ErrorBoundary,
# plus uncaught window errors/unhandled promise rejections, reported to
# Sentry. Must be set at build time (Vite inlines VITE_-prefixed vars into
# the bundle) — see also the server's SENTRY_DSN (server/.env.example) for
# server-side error reporting, a separate Sentry project/DSN.
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
